  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Dragonfish look like red carps, but much larger. Their battle strength is bottom tier. They are not a natural life form; a food path Gu Immortal created them. Market dragonfish carry food path dao marks mixed with dao marks from other paths.",
      "chapters": [
        1477
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Copper dragonfish are a superior modified species with a higher proportion of food path dao marks than ordinary dragonfish.",
      "chapters": [
        1477
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "You Chan treats ordinary dragonfish as unable to keep her in competition once copper stock appears.",
      "chapters": [
        1478
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_you_chan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In dragon scale sea area, most of Fang Yuan’s swimming dragonfish are ordinary red dragonfish, about thirty percent are copper dragonfish, and the rest are black iron dragonfish.",
      "chapters": [
        1482
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "stock-mix",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The copper, iron, gold, and silver breeds are modified stock, distinct from this ordinary red baseline.",
